{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30607","headline":"和主司王起 · 丘上卿","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常将公道选诸生，不是鸳鸿不得名。\n天上宴回联步武，禁中麻出满寰瀛。\n簪裾尽过前贤贵，门馆仍叨旧学荣。\n看着凤池相继入，都堂那肯滞关营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘上卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}